Hello,

I'm not sure completely but your model looked mostly okay to me. Are you meaning to consider Year a fixed effect? I would probably think about specifying the repeated measures as Year|SamplePer|Subarea|PlotID because that is what is repeatedly measured but I'm not sure. I'm not sure if this was helpful, but I wanted to try to help.

Best,
Hanna Kahl

