I have a matrix of 10 by 20 with 12 different letters. each letter represent a vector of 3 numbers.
there is a key  like: S= [90 5 5] and so on

how can I change all the letters, into numbers? make 3 matrix each time substitute the letter to the number it represents

data.frame=[S  IL  SL  C  LO IL IL S S ] , and it goes on  (10 by 20)
S=[90 5 5]
IL=[80 5 15]
SL=[65 10 25]
C=[20 65 15]
LO=[40 20 40]

new.data.frame1=[90 80 65 20 40 80 80 90 90]
new.data.frame2=[5 5 10 65 20 5 5 5 5]

